return ['domain'=>'zinn-migrate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-migrate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-09T22:25:23+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-09T22:25:23+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Migrate'=>'Zinn® Migrate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate','Packages this WordPress site — files and database — into one archive that Zinn Digital® can pull in, for hosts we cannot reach any other way. Install it on the site you are LEAVING, press one button, and paste the link into your Zinn® migration.'=>'Yana tara wannan rukunin yanar gizon WordPress — fayiloli da bayanan bayanai — zuwa cikin jakar ajiya guda ɗaya wacce Zinn Digital® za ta iya jawowa, don masu masaukin baki da ba za mu iya isa gare ta ta wata hanya ba. Sanya shi a kan rukunin yanar gizon da kakeBARI, danna maballin guda ɗaya, kuma manna hanyar haɗin a cikin hijirarka ta Zinn®.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Move this site to Zinn®'=>'Matsar da wannan shafin zuwa Zinn®','Move to Zinn®'=>'Muruda zuwa Zinn®','You do not have permission to do this.'=>'Ba ka da izinin yin wannan.','This packages everything on this site — its files and its database — into one archive, and gives you a private link to it. Paste that link into your migration on Zinn® and we will pull the site across. Nothing here is sent anywhere until you choose to share the link.'=>'Wannan yana tattara komai a kan wannan rukunin yanar gizon — fayilolinsa da bayanan bayanan sa — zuwa cikin kundin adana bayanai guda ɗaya, kuma yana ba ku keɓaɓɓen mahada zuwa gare shi. Liƙa wannan mahada cikin ƙaura a Zinn® kuma za mu ja shafin a fadin. Babu wani abu da ake aikawa ko ina anan har sai kun zaɓi raba mahadar.','You may not need this. If your old host gives you FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk or DirectAdmin, Zinn® can fetch the site directly with those details and you can skip this plugin entirely — it is faster and there is nothing left behind afterwards. Use this when none of those are available to you.'=>'Wataƙila ba ka buƙatar wannan ba. Idan tsohon mai masaukin yanar gizonka ya ba ka FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk ko DirectAdmin, Zinn® na iya ɗaukar shafin kai tsaye da waɗannan bayanan kuma za ka iya tsallake wannanplugin ɗin gaba ɗaya — yana da sauri kuma babu abin da ya rage a baya daga baya. Yi amfani da wannan lokacin da babu wani daga cikin waɗannan da ke gare ka.','Room on this server'=>'Wuri a kan wannan uwar garken','This server will not tell us how much disk space is free, so we cannot check for you. The package needs roughly %s. If you are not sure there is that much room, ask your host before you build it — a server that runs out of space mid-way takes the site down.'=>'Wannan sabar ba za ta gaya mana adadin sararin da ya rage a rumbun ajiyarta ba, saboda haka ba za mu iya bincika maka ba. Kunshin yana buƙatar kimanin %s. Idan ba ka da tabbas akwai wannan sarari, tambayi mai sabar ɗin kafin ka gina shi — sabar da ta ƙare mata sarari a tsakiyar aiki tana ɗauke da shafin.','The package needs roughly %1$s and this server has %2$s free.'=>'Kunshin yana buƙatar kusan %1$s kuma wannan uwar garken tana da %2$s kyauta.','Build the package'=>'Gina kunshin','Building…'=>'Ana ginawa…','Now packaging: %1$s. %2$s files so far, %3$s written.'=>'Yanzu ana shiryawa: %1$s. Fayiloli %2$s kawo yanzu, %3$s an rubuta.','your files'=>'fayilolinka','your database'=>'ma\'ajiyar bayananka','Continue'=>'Ci gaba','Cancel and delete'=>'Soke sannan ka share','Your package is ready'=>'Kunshin ku a shirye yake','Copy this link and paste it into your migration on Zinn®:'=>'Kwafi wannan hanyar haɗin gwiwa sannan ka manna shi a cikin ƙaura ta Zinn®:','Size: %s.'=>'Girman: %s.','Treat this link like a password. Anyone who has it can download your whole site, including your database. We delete the package automatically 24 hours after it was built — delete it yourself as soon as your migration has finished.'=>'Ka dauki wannan hanyar sadarwa kamar kalmar sirri. Duk wanda yake da ita zai iya sauke daukacin shafinka, ciki har da bayanan ajiyarka. Muna goge fakitin da kansa bayan sa\'o\'i 24 da aka kirkire shi — ka goge shi da kanka da zaran ka gama hijirar shafin.','Delete the package now'=>'Share fakitin yanzu','Build it again'=>'Sake ginawa','This server does not have PHP’s ZipArchive extension, so we cannot build a package here. Ask your host to enable it, or use the migration form on Zinn® with your FTP or SSH details instead.'=>'Wannan uwar garken ba ta da tsarin ZipArchive na PHP, don haka ba za mu iya gina kunshin a nan ba. Ka roƙi mai masaukin baƙi naka da ya kunna shi, ko kuma a maimakon haka ka yi amfani da fom ɗin ƙaura a kan Zinn® tare da bayanan FTP ko SSH naka.','We could not create a folder inside your uploads directory, so there is nowhere to write the package. Check that wp-content/uploads is writable.'=>'Ba mu iya ƙirƙirar babban fayil ba a cikin kundin adireshin ku na lodawa, don haka babu inda za a rubuta fakitin. Bincika cewa wp-content/uploads yana da izinin rubutawa.','There is no package being built. Start one first.'=>'Babu wani kunshin da ake ginawa. Fara guda ɗaya tukunna.','We could not open the package file for writing.'=>'Ba mu iya buɗe fayil ɗin kunshin don rubutawa ba.','We could not write the database export.'=>'Ba mu iya rubuta fitar da bayanan ba.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin masu amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani ta %s','Hide this'=>'Boye da wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® hosting don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, madogaransa na kullum, ƙaura kyauta da kuma allon sarrafawa da aka gina don mutanen da ke gudanar da shafuka fiye da ɗaya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwar Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayi da siyar da ingantattun shafuka, yanki (domains), da wuraren sanya hanyoyin sadarwa (link placements), tare da ajiye kudin a amince har sai bangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — hayar mutanen da suka kware a fannin aikinsu','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwancinmu na masu zaman kansu na duniya: bincika ayyuka sama da 10,000 da aka riga aka shirya daga marubuta, masu zanen kaya, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko sanya wani aikin kuma bari su yi ciniki.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Dubi bayanan fitowar Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sabuntawar da aka sauke ta gaza a wajen tantance amincinta kuma ba a shigar da ita ba.']];